==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (600%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Zomboe]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Once again, the magnifications are rather low here, so almost any strategy will work, but [[Zombie Cat (Special Cat)|Skelecat]] will do well here since all the enemies are within his target traits. If you have [[Ancient Egg: N205 (Special Cat)|Bride Cat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] by now, they will also massively help with dealing with the enemies.

